Project 0 

Resources and documentation can be found in each .cpp file in the 'src' directory.

How to compile:
    1. make sure you are in the Project-0 directory
    2. in the terminal, run the "make" command to compile the programs
    3. the finished executuble 'P0' can be found in the 'build' directory (Project-0/build)
